* Task 8 fixture: Record UPDATE/DELETE write edges with empty Name
* Tests extraction of record-form UPDATE and DELETE (no file operand).
* These statements have no explicit target; they operate on the record
* from the enclosing READ/FIND/GET loop.
* Acceptance criterion: extract writes with empty Name and statement Source range.

DEFINE DATA
LOCAL
  1 ISN (P9.9)
END DEFINE

READ EMPLOYEES
  UPDATE
END

STORE EMPLOYEES

READ VEHICLES
  DELETE (VAR1)
END

END
